╭────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│  Keys                                                                                                                  │
│                                                                                                                        │
│  Browse                                                       Edit                                                     │
│    j / k     scroll one line                                    e         edit current page in-app                     │
│    ctrl-d    half page down                                     E         edit current page in $EDITOR                 │
│    ctrl-u    half page up                                       ctrl-s    save; merges outside edits, asks on a clash  │
│    g / G     top / bottom                                       pgup/pgdn page up / down (while editing)               │
│                                                                 enter     continue list bullet (empty bullet ends it)  │
│  Links                                                          ctrl-t    cycle TODO / DONE on the current bullet      │
│    n / N     next / previous wiki-link                          tab       indent the current line                      │
│    enter     follow link under cursor                           shift-tab de-indent the current line                   │
│                                                                 esc       leave editor (prompts if unsaved)            │
│  History                                                        [[        start wiki-link; pick a page to complete     │
│    [         back                                               ↑ / ↓     choose completion (list open)                │
│    ]         forward                                            enter/tab insert selected link                         │
│                                                                 esc       dismiss completion list                      │
│  Open                                                                                                                  │
│    .         today's journal                                  Maintain                                                 │
│    <         previous journal                                   R         rebuild index                                │
│    >         next journal                                                                                              │
│    ctrl-p    picker — find any page                           Help / quit                                              │
│    /         search the graph (ripgrep)                         ?         toggle this help                             │
│    b         backlinks + unlinked refs for the current page     esc       close overlay                                │
│    T         open todos dashboard                               q         quit                                         │
│                                                                                                                        │
│  Sync                                                                                                                  │
│    S         commit, pull & push the graph (git)                                                                       │
│                                                                                                                        │
│  ? or esc to close                                                                                        weft v1.0.0  │
╰────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯